    "Codeblock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Code block."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dafür verlässt kein Wort dieser Unterhaltung das Telefon.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not a word of this conversation leaves the phone for that."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dafür wird ein eingerichtetes Modell gebraucht. Trage zuerst unter Einstellungen › Modell einen Endpoint ein.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That needs a model that is set up. Enter an endpoint first under Settings › Model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Darauf beziehen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refer to this"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Feld \"%@\" gibt es in den Treffern nicht — dort stand kein Text. Nenne das Feld mit dem beschreibenden Text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The results have no field \"%@\" — no text was found there. Name the field with the descriptive text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Feld \"%@\" gibt es in den Treffern nicht — dort stand kein Titel. Nenne das Feld, das den Titel wirklich enthält.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The results have no field \"%@\" — no title was found there. Name the field that actually holds the title."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Mikrofon": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Mikrofon ist nicht erlaubt. In den iOS-Einstellungen unter Faden freigeben.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone is not allowed. Turn it on in the iOS Settings under Faden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Mikrofon ließ sich nicht öffnen: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone could not be opened: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Mikrofon meldet sich nicht. Läuft gerade eine Aufnahme in einer anderen App, oder ist ein Headset im Wechsel?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone is not responding. Is another app recording right now, or is a headset being switched?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Modell antwortet: „%@“": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model replies: “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Modell hat keinen Text geliefert.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model returned no text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Modell hat nichts zurückgegeben.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model returned nothing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Modell hat nur nachgedacht und keinen Text geliefert. Eine höhere maximale Antwortlänge hilft.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model only thought and delivered no text. A higher maximum answer length helps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Modell im System. Ohne Endpoint, ohne Schlüssel, ohne Netz — und ohne Werkzeuge und Bilder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model built into the system. No endpoint, no key, no network — and no tools or images."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Modell konnte nicht geladen werden (%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model could not be downloaded (%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Modell liegt auf dem Gerät. Gespräche damit verlassen das Telefon nicht.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model is on the device. Conversations with it do not leave the phone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Modell liegt gerade nicht auf dem Gerät. Das System lädt es bei Netz und Ladekabel nach.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model is not on the device right now. The system downloads it when there is a network and a charger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Modell war nicht erreichbar: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model could not be reached: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Modell wurde nicht geladen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model was not downloaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das System gibt das Modell gerade nicht frei.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system is not making the model available right now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das System hat die Anfragen gedrosselt — gleich noch einmal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system is throttling requests — try again in a moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das System hat noch nicht geantwortet. Der Download läuft unter Umständen weiter — beim nächsten Öffnen steht hier, ob er angekommen ist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system has not answered yet. The download may still be running — next time you open this, it will say whether it arrived."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das System lädt das Modell im Hintergrund — das passiert bei Netz und Ladekabel. Später erneut versuchen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system downloads the model in the background — that happens with a network and a charger. Try again later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Testbild ließ sich nicht erzeugen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The test image could not be created."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das gewählte Modell ist nicht vollständig eingerichtet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The chosen model is not fully set up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das lokale Modell": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das lokale Modell ist noch nicht geladen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local model is not downloaded yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Datum, Uhrzeit und Zeitzone deines Geräts": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your device's date, time and time zone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dein Endpoint": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your endpoint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deine Nachrichten, den bisherigen Verlauf der Unterhaltung und deine Anweisungen an Faden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your messages, the conversation so far and your instructions to Faden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deine Sprachaufnahmen, um sie in Text umzuwandeln": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your voice recordings, to turn them into text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Denkt nach": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thinking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Anbieter antwortete mit HTTP %lld, aber die Ergebnisse standen nicht dort, wo erwartet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The provider answered with HTTP %lld, but the results were not where they were expected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Anbieter antwortete mit HTTP %lld.\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Der Anbieter antwortete mit HTTP %1$lld.\n%2$@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The provider answered with HTTP %lld.\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Anbieter drosselt gerade (HTTP %lld) — auch nach zwei Wartepausen noch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The provider is throttling right now (HTTP %lld) — still, after two waits."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Anbieter nennt für dieses Modell keine Grenzen — die Regler bleiben deine Schätzung.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The provider states no limits for this model — the sliders remain your estimate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Anbieter nennt keine Token-Grenzen. Die Regler bleiben deine Schätzung — stösst eine Antwort wirklich an eine Grenze, trägt die App sie hier ein.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The provider states no token limits. The sliders remain your estimate — if an answer actually hits a limit, the app fills it in here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Anbieter verarbeitet diese Daten nach seinen eigenen Bedingungen und seiner Datenschutzerklärung. Faden fragt pro Anbieter einmal; ohne dein Einverständnis wird nichts gesendet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The provider processes this data under its own terms and privacy policy. Faden asks once per provider; without your agreement, nothing is sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Einbettungs-Endpoint": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The embedding endpoint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Endpoint für Sprachausgabe": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The speech output endpoint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Endpoint für Spracherkennung": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The speech recognition endpoint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Endpoint hat das Bild abgelehnt (HTTP %lld). ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The endpoint rejected the image (HTTP %lld). "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Endpoint spricht dasselbe Format wie dein Modell — oft derselbe Anbieter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The endpoint speaks the same format as your model — often the same provider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Gedankengang war länger als der Vorrat. Antwortlänge auf %lld Token erhöht.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The reasoning ran longer than the budget. Answer length raised to %lld tokens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Modellname lässt sich auch von Hand eintragen:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model name can also be typed by hand:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Modellname lässt sich weiterhin von Hand eintragen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model name can still be typed by hand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Ordner ließ sich nicht dauerhaft merken: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The folder could not be remembered: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Parser ist reine Konfiguration und läuft ab jetzt lokal auf diesem iPhone — für Suchen wird kein Modell mehr gebraucht.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The parser is pure configuration and runs locally on this iPhone from now on — searching no longer needs a model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Parser ließ sich nicht ableiten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The parser could not be derived."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Parser wurde von %@ aus einer echten Antwort dieses Endpoints abgeleitet und läuft seitdem lokal auf diesem Gerät.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ derived the parser from a real answer of this endpoint, and it has run locally on this device ever since."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Test lieferte zwar Treffer, aber du hältst sie für falsch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The test did return results, but you think they are wrong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Text konnte nicht eingebettet werden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The text could not be embedded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Verbindungstest probiert es selbst aus und setzt den Schalter entsprechend.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection test tries it out itself and sets the switch accordingly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Verbindungstest ruft ein Werkzeug auf, das nichts tut. Kommt dabei ein Gedankengang mit, steht auch das fest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection test calls a tool that does nothing. If reasoning comes back with it, that is settled too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Verlauf ließ sich nicht verdichten: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The history could not be compacted: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der eigene Erkennungsdienst antwortete nicht, erkannt hat es Apple. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your own recognition service did not answer; Apple did the recognising. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der gemeinsame Ordner der eigenhand-Apps ist in diesem Build nicht freigeschaltet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The shared folder of the eigenhand apps is not enabled in this build."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der gesamte Wissensgraph wird gelöscht. Die Unterhaltungen selbst bleiben.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The entire knowledge graph is deleted. The conversations themselves stay."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Details": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Details"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deutlich schwächer als ein großes Modell am Endpoint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clearly weaker than a large model at an endpoint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Antwort darauf und alles danach wird verworfen und neu beantwortet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The answer to this and everything after it is discarded and answered again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Antwort des Modells war nicht lesbar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model's answer could not be read."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Antwort läuft noch. Stoppe sie, wenn du etwas anderes fragen willst.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The answer is still running. Stop it if you want to ask something else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Antwort war kein JSON-Objekt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The response was not a JSON object."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Antwort war leer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The answer was empty."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Antworten, die vorgelesen werden sollen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The answers to be read aloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Datei ist %.1f MB groß. Übernommen werden höchstens %lld MB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Die Datei ist %1$.1f MB groß. Übernommen werden höchstens %2$lld MB."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The file is %.1f MB. At most %lld MB are taken over."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Fakten sind gespeichert, nur noch nicht durchsuchbar. Faden versucht es im Minutentakt weiter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The facts are saved, only not searchable yet. Faden keeps trying every minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Felder lassen sich unter „Details“ im Anbieter auch von Hand eintragen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The fields can also be typed by hand under “Details” in the provider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Liste enthielt keine Modelle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The list contained no models."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Spracherkennung": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speech recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Spracherkennung ist nicht erlaubt. In den iOS-Einstellungen unter Faden freigeben.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speech recognition is not allowed. Turn it on in the iOS Settings under Faden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Stimme gehört zum festen Teil der Anweisungen und ändert sich nur, wenn du sie änderst — sie kostet daher keine zusätzlichen Token pro Frage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The voice belongs to the fixed part of the instructions and changes only when you change it — so it costs no extra tokens per question."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die URL des Suchanbieters ist ungültig.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The search provider's URL is not valid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Unterhaltung ist zu lang für das Modell auf dem Gerät. Sein Kontextfenster ist klein — verdichten oder neu anfangen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The conversation is too long for the model on the device. Its context window is small — compact it or start over."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Vektoren werden entfernt, die Fakten bleiben.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The vectors are removed, the facts stay."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die im iPhone eingebaute Stimme. Braucht keinen Dienst und kein Netz.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The voice built into the iPhone. Needs no service and no network."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dienste": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Services"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diese Sprache beherrscht das Modell auf dem Gerät nicht.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model on the device does not speak this language."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diese Vektoren zählen nicht mit — sie stammen aus einem anderen Raum. Beim nächsten Nachholen werden sie ersetzt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These vectors do not count — they come from a different space. They will be replaced the next time the backlog is filled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diesen Eintrag vergessen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Forget this entry"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dieses Gerät bringt das Modell nicht mit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device does not carry the model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dieses iPhone unterstützt Apple Intelligence nicht. Nötig ist ein iPhone 15 Pro oder neuer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This iPhone does not support Apple Intelligence. It needs an iPhone 15 Pro or newer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diktat und Vorlesen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dictation and reading aloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dunkel": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dark"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eigene Anweisungen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your own instructions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eigener Anbieter": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Custom provider"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eigener Endpoint": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Custom endpoint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eigenes Format. Erweitertes Denken und Prompt-Caching gibt es nur hier.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its own format. Extended thinking and prompt caching are only available here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eigenes Modell für Bilder": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Separate model for images"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ein Bild aus der Mediathek erklären lassen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Have an image from the library explained"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ein Endpoint lässt sich jederzeit daneben einrichten. Dann steht beides zur Wahl, und diese Unterhaltung hier bleibt auf dem Gerät.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An endpoint can be set up alongside at any time. Then both are available to choose from, and this conversation stays on the device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ein Foto aufnehmen und erklären lassen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Take a photo and have it explained"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ein Schritt": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One step"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ein Wechsel macht den vorhandenen Index unbrauchbar — die Vektoren der anderen Quelle liegen in einem anderen Raum. Sie werden ersetzt, unten steht wie viele.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switching makes the existing index unusable — the vectors from the other source live in a different space. They will be replaced; how many is shown below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ein Werkzeug bekommt der Assistent erst, wenn der Dienst hier verbunden ist. Nicht verbunden heißt: es wird ihm gar nicht erst angeboten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The assistant gets a tool only once the service is connected here. Not connected means it is not offered to it at all."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einbettung fehlgeschlagen: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Embedding failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einbettung testen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Test embedding"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einbettung wartet auf den Anbieter (Versuch %lld) …": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Embedding is waiting for the provider (attempt %lld) …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einbettungen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Embeddings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eine Quelle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One source"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eingerichtete Modelle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Models that are set up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einrichten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einrichten lassen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Have it set up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einstellungen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einverstanden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agree"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einzelne Schritte anzeigen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show the individual steps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endpoint": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Endpoint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endpoint automatisch einrichten?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set up the endpoint automatically?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endpoint oder Modellname fehlt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The endpoint or model name is missing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erinnerungen pro Antwort": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Memories per answer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erscheinungsbild": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appearance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erweitertes Denken anfordern": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Request extended thinking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es gab noch nichts zu verdichten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There was nothing to compact yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es kamen %lld Vektoren für %lld Texte zurück.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Got %lld vectors back for %lld texts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es läuft schon eine Anfrage an das Modell. Das System nimmt nur eine auf einmal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A request to the model is already running. The system takes only one at a time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden ${question} fragen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask Faden ${question}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden baut aus euren Gesprächen einen Wissensgraphen: Dinge und ihre Beziehungen, statt loser Notizen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faden builds a knowledge graph out of your conversations: things and their relationships, rather than loose notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden bringt kein Modell und keinen Suchanbieter mit. Trage deinen Endpoint, deinen Key und den Modellnamen ein — deine Chats liegen nur auf diesem Gerät und gehen nur an den Anbieter, den du einrichtest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faden brings no model and no search provider with it. Enter your endpoint, your key and the model name — your chats are stored only on this device and go only to the provider you set up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden fragen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask Faden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden hat keinen eigenen Server. Damit du eine Antwort bekommst, geht Folgendes direkt an den Anbieter, den du eingerichtet hast:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faden has no server of its own. To get you an answer, the following goes directly to the provider you set up:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faden schreibt weiter": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faden keeps writing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fasse das kürzer — die Hälfte, gleiche Substanz.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Make that shorter — half the length, same substance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fasst den älteren Verlauf im Hintergrund zusammen, sobald die Schwelle erreicht ist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarises the older history in the background once the threshold is reached."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fehlgeschlagen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feld `data` fehlt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The `data` field is missing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fertig": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fertig — %lld Treffer über den neuen Parser.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done — %lld results through the new parser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Format": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Format"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Formulier mir eine kurze, freundliche Absage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write me a short, friendly decline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Foto aufnehmen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Take a photo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frag mich etwas": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask me something"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frage": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frage bearbeiten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit the question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frage den Endpoint": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask the endpoint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fragen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freihändig sprechen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speak hands-free"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Funktioniert — %lld Dimensionen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Works — %lld dimensions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fällt der Dienst aus, liest Apple dieselbe Aufnahme — gesprochenes geht nicht verloren.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the service fails, Apple reads the same recording — nothing spoken is lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für %@ steht keine Spracherkennung bereit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No speech recognition is available for %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für das Gedächtnis": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For memory"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für das Vorlesen im Sprachmodus muss oben eine Stimme gewählt sein.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reading aloud in voice mode needs a voice chosen above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für das Wiederfinden braucht es Vektoren. Sie entstehen bei deinem Anbieter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finding things again takes vectors. They are made at your provider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für die Antworten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For answers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für die Sprachausgabe": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For speech output"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für die Spracherkennung": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For speech recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für die Websuche": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For web search"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für diese Sprache steht keine Erkennung bereit. Ein eigener Endpoint funktioniert trotzdem.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No recognition is available for this language. Your own endpoint still works."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ganze Nachricht": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The whole message"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ganze Nachricht zeigen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show the whole message"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gedankengang": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reasoning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gedankengang anzeigen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show reasoning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gedächtnis": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Memory"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gedächtnis führen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep a memory"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Geh darauf genauer ein.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go into more detail on that."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gelesen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gelöscht wird nur der Index, nicht das Gemerkte. Die Fakten bleiben; bis ein neuer Index steht, findet die Ähnlichkeitssuche sie nicht. Solange das Gedächtnis an ist und ein Endpoint steht, baut Faden ihn von selbst wieder auf.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the index is deleted, not what was remembered. The facts stay; until a new index exists, the similarity search will not find them. As long as the memory is on and an endpoint is set, Faden rebuilds it by itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gerät zu alt": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Device too old"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gespeicherte Gedanken": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved thoughts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gesprochen. Nichts gehört? Dann Lautstärke und Stummschalter prüfen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spoken. Heard nothing? Then check the volume and the mute switch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gestern": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yesterday"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gesucht": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Searched"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gilt für die Oberfläche. Systemdialoge — etwa die Frage nach Kamera oder Mikrofon — folgen weiterhin der Spracheinstellung des Geräts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to the interface. System dialogs — the camera or microphone prompt, for instance — still follow the device's language setting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grenzen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limits"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP %lld\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "HTTP %1$lld\n%2$@"
          }
