          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Light"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heute": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hole %lld Einbettungen nach …": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Catching up on %lld embeddings …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hängt an einem Zug ein Bild, geht genau dieser Zug an das Vision-Modell — alle anderen bleiben beim Hauptmodell. Für Modelle, die alles besser können ausser sehen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a turn carries an image, that turn alone goes to the vision model — all others stay with the main model. For models that do everything better except see."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Im Bestand nachgesehen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checked the inventory"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Im Gedächtnis nachgesehen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checked memory"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Im Gedächtnis suchen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search the memory"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Im Sprachmodus sendet Faden von selbst, sobald du eine Weile still bist, liest die Antwort vor und hört dann wieder zu. Zu erreichen über das Wellen-Symbol oben im Chat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In voice mode, Faden sends on its own once you have been quiet for a moment, reads the answer aloud and then listens again. Reach it via the wave symbol at the top of the chat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Im System": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the system"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In den Systemeinstellungen unter „Apple Intelligence & Siri“ einschalten, dann hier zurückkommen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn it on in Settings under “Apple Intelligence & Siri”, then come back here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Index": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Index"
          }
        }
      }
    },
