            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rebuild the index?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jetzt nachholen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Catch up now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jetzt verdichten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compact now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kein API-Key im Schlüsselbund hinterlegt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No API key deposited in the keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kein Bestand gefunden. Es gibt ihn, sobald in Fundus auf diesem Gerät der erste Eintrag steht.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No inventory found. There will be one as soon as Fundus on this device holds its first entry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kein Modell eingetragen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No model entered"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kein Modell konfiguriert. Endpoint, Key und Modellname fehlen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No model configured. The endpoint, the key and the model name are missing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kein Satz verlässt das Telefon, und es braucht keinen Endpoint. Dafür trifft es gröber: auf neun Fragen gegen vierzehn Erinnerungen fünfmal richtig gegen siebenmal beim Netzmodell. Eingebettet wird in 8 ms je Satz statt gut acht Sekunden für eine ganze Aufnahme.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No sentence leaves the phone, and no endpoint is needed. In return it is less precise: on nine questions against fourteen memories it was right five times, against seven for the network model. Embedding takes 8 ms per sentence instead of a good eight seconds for a whole recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kein Suchanbieter eingerichtet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No search provider set up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kein Vektor erhalten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No vector received."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keine Bilder — das Modell liest nur Text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No images — the model reads only text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
